          "guid": "mt47qa6wpfbtm6h0",
          "message": {
            "text": "The hard final-SVG leg exposed an atomic-clone clipping defect that the exact CTM leg could not see. A re-embedded SVG defaults to clipped overflow, so transformed stroke/off-bounds ink shifted by large device-space bounds until the live root overflow was baked; preserving child filter/non-visible overflow at the same ownership boundary also makes grouping-paint rows pass.",
            "markdown": "The hard final-SVG leg exposed an atomic-clone clipping defect that the exact CTM leg could not see. A re-embedded SVG defaults to clipped overflow, so transformed stroke/off-bounds ink shifted by large device-space bounds until the live root overflow was baked; preserving child filter/non-visible overflow at the same ownership boundary also makes grouping-paint rows pass."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/script/walker/inline-svg.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 171,
                  "endLine": 177,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "      // An outer SVG viewport defaults to overflow:hidden when re-embedded,\n      // while authored CSS commonly switches the live root to visible. The\n      // renderer treats svgContent as atomic and therefore cannot reconstruct\n      // this clip outside the clone; bake the live used value onto the cloned\n      // root so transformed stroke/off-bounds ink keeps Chromium's boundary.\n      const svgOverflow = cs.getPropertyValue('overflow').trim();\n      if (svgOverflow !== '') clone.style.setProperty('overflow', svgOverflow);"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
